1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,900
Kamu berputar beberapa kali,

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:03,300
lalu berhenti,

3
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:05,500
tetapi rasanya ruangan masih berputar.

4
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:06,400
Kenapa?

5
00:00:06,820 --> 00:00:08,150
Di telinga dalam,

6
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:09,780
ada saluran setengah lingkaran

7
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:10,620
berisi cairan.

8
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:12,420
Saat kepala mulai berputar,

9
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:13,720
salurannya ikut bergerak,

10
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,580
sementara cairannya sempat tertinggal

11
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:16,550
karena inersia.

12
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,780
Gerakan relatif ini membengkokkan

13
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:19,960
struktur sensorik

14
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:21,080
dan sel rambut di dalamnya.

15
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,200
Saraf lalu mengirim pesan

16
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:24,950
ke otak bahwa kepala sedang berputar.

17
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:26,880
Kalau putaran berlangsung terus,

18
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:28,920
sinyal putarannya pun bisa melemah,

19
00:00:28,950 --> 00:00:30,920
meskipun tubuh masih berputar.

20
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:32,920
Begitu kamu mendadak berhenti,

21
00:00:32,950 --> 00:00:34,350
salurannya ikut berhenti.

22
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:36,120
Cairan di dalamnya

23
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:37,340
masih bergerak sesaat

24
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:38,300
dan membengkokkan sensor

25
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:39,320
ke arah sebaliknya.

26
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:41,400
Otak menerima sinyal seolah

27
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:42,760
kepala masih berputar,

28
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:44,720
bahkan bisa terasa ke arah berlawanan.

29
00:00:45,360 --> 00:00:46,900
Setelah cairannya tenang

30
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:48,360
dan sinyalnya kembali seimbang,

31
00:00:48,380 --> 00:00:50,250
sensasi berputar itu mereda.

32
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:56,200
Di MEDCOEL, jelajahi Atlas 3D dan Live 4D Lab.

33
00:00:56,420 --> 00:01:00,220
Lanjut belajar lewat materi, latihan soal, dan Simulasi Dokter.

34
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:02,660
Gratis di medcoel.com.

